  description: "Activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Target 3 of your FIRE monsters
    that are banished and/or in your GY; shuffle 2 of the 3 into the Deck, and if
    you do, Special Summon the remaining monster, but for the rest of this turn,
    its effects are negated, also it cannot attack.\r\n\u25CF If you control a FIRE
    Ritual, Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster(s) whose current ATK is different
    from its original ATK: You can target 1 card on the field; destroy it.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Salamangreat Charge\" per turn."
